# chi-agent environment configuration example
# Copy to .env and fill in real values.  .env is git-ignored.
#
# REQUIRED for a real chi-bench run (judge calls claude-opus-4-7):
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
#
# Required only when using an OpenAI-compatible harness (e.g. openai-agents):
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
#
# Required only when routing through OpenRouter:
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=sk-or-...
#
# chi-bench Kaggle competition registration:
#   https://www.kaggle.com/competitions/chi-bench
#
# Managed-Care Operations Handbook (handbook access — human review, ~1 business day):
#   https://huggingface.co/datasets/actava/managed-care-operations-handbook
